xray-gateway (1.7.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release. Previously installed by copying files into
    /opt/xray-proxy with install.sh.
  * Split the xray-core binary into xray-gateway-core so the core can be
    updated on its own.
  * geoip/geosite rule sets are downloaded after installation and refreshed
    weekly by xray-geoupdate.timer instead of being shipped in the package.
  * Network detection moved out of install.sh into xray-gateway-setup, which
    now recognises the inline layout and records WAN_IF and TOPOLOGY.

